warning[SCRIPTS-LINT-0002]: use of `process.run_shell`: the string is interpreted by `/bin/sh` (injection risk)
  --> run_shell.scs:1:23
   |
 1 | let outcome = process.run_shell("printf 'a-b'")?
   |                       ^^^^^^^^^
   = cause: `process.run_shell` is the only explicit door to `/bin/sh`; any external data inserted into the command can inject commands
   = suggestion: prefer `process.run(process.request(program, arguments))`; if `process.run_shell` is unavoidable, never insert untrusted data into it
